WEBVTT

00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:07.160
Itsuki, can you stand? Let's go after them.

00:00:07.160 --> 00:00:08.230
Yeah.

00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:12.610
Wait, Itsuki.

00:00:13.070 --> 00:00:14.280
Kota.

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:16.320
What in the world is going on?

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:17.870
You'll get in trouble for 
destroying the school.

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:20.260
And that's one hell of a costume.

00:00:20.260 --> 00:00:22.630
Is that a wig? And you, too, Aika-chan.

00:00:22.630 --> 00:00:26.500
I know this is hard to believe, 
but ORACLE really exists.

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:28.120
S-Seriously?

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:30.550
That's not funny, Itsuki.

00:00:30.890 --> 00:00:33.260
So, where'd Izumi-senpai go?

00:00:34.750 --> 00:00:38.010
Huh? Itsuki? Aika-chan?

00:02:08.230 --> 00:02:10.560
<b>Quest 11     The Dark Falz</b>

00:02:14.520 --> 00:02:15.770
Let's break through.

00:02:25.840 --> 00:02:27.610
<i>Aika, you can hear me, can't you?</i>

00:02:27.610 --> 00:02:30.120
Yes. As you can see in 
the video I just sent—

00:02:30.120 --> 00:02:31.990
<i>I know what's going on.</i>

00:02:31.990 --> 00:02:34.380
<i>I'll send reinforcements, 
but there's no time.</i>

00:02:34.380 --> 00:02:37.310
<i>Look for the target yourselves.</i>

00:02:37.310 --> 00:02:38.110
Yes, sir.

00:02:38.420 --> 00:02:39.630
Where's Rina-senpai?

00:02:41.560 --> 00:02:43.650
She's somewhere on this planet.

00:02:58.400 --> 00:02:59.520
They're coming!

00:03:07.310 --> 00:03:08.300
What is that?

00:03:12.710 --> 00:03:15.100
Rina-senpai's in there?

00:03:32.120 --> 00:03:33.980
Rina-senpai?

00:03:38.730 --> 00:03:41.240
Rina-senpai! Let's go home.

00:03:45.950 --> 00:03:47.530
Itsuki, watch out!

00:03:54.630 --> 00:03:56.340
Run, Itsuki.

00:03:56.950 --> 00:03:58.370
What are you talking about?

00:03:58.370 --> 00:04:00.540
Are you telling me to 
leave Rina-senpai behind?

00:04:00.540 --> 00:04:02.150
That's not Rina anymore.

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:11.600
Itsuki...

00:04:19.110 --> 00:04:21.610
I'm right on time.

00:04:21.980 --> 00:04:25.110
I always show up when my 
friends are in trouble.

00:04:27.340 --> 00:04:28.200
Jeez.

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:32.200
Have you already taken the 
gloves off, Dark Falz?

00:04:33.210 --> 00:04:35.980
Aika! Take him and go!

00:04:35.980 --> 00:04:37.710
But alone, you...

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:40.300
You'd just get in my way.

00:04:40.300 --> 00:04:41.460
Hurry up and go!

00:04:43.980 --> 00:04:45.090
I'm counting on you.

00:04:47.050 --> 00:04:48.350
Now then...

00:04:48.350 --> 00:04:52.150
Guess I'll buy as much time as I can.

00:04:56.190 --> 00:04:57.310
Itsuki.

00:04:58.800 --> 00:04:59.910
Ow...

00:05:01.380 --> 00:05:02.800
Where's Rina-senpai?

00:05:07.560 --> 00:05:11.830
Izumi Rina has been chosen 
to be the Dark Falz's vessel.

00:05:12.360 --> 00:05:16.580
Her body is being controlled 
by the Dark Falz.

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:17.960
She's what?

00:05:18.260 --> 00:05:22.210
She will eventually become 
one with the Dark Falz.

00:05:22.740 --> 00:05:25.170
I wanted to stop him before 
that happened, but...

00:05:29.470 --> 00:05:30.720
I'll help you look for her.

00:05:33.320 --> 00:05:36.340
Finding the Dark Falz will be
 incredibly difficult.

00:05:36.630 --> 00:05:38.490
Let us handle this.

00:05:38.490 --> 00:05:39.230
But...

00:05:39.960 --> 00:05:41.980
There's nothing you can do now.

00:05:43.520 --> 00:05:46.400
But it's my fault Rina-senpai was kidnapped.

00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:48.240
And you're telling me to do nothing?

00:05:48.860 --> 00:05:50.360
Go back to Earth.

00:05:50.360 --> 00:05:51.240
Aika!

00:05:52.070 --> 00:05:54.370
Think about when Rina returns.

00:05:55.240 --> 00:05:56.800
When she returns...

00:06:12.130 --> 00:06:15.640
<i>The first day of the school 
festival will end shortly.</i>

00:06:16.380 --> 00:06:19.960
<i>Student council members, 
please come to the student council room.</i>

00:06:25.650 --> 00:06:29.390
<i>What can I do for Rina-senpai right now?</i>

00:06:31.860 --> 00:06:34.160
The president's still 
not answering her phone?

00:06:34.480 --> 00:06:35.660
It's been unreachable this whole time.

00:06:40.540 --> 00:06:42.820
Tachibana-kun, where have you been?

00:06:42.820 --> 00:06:43.880
Where's the president?

00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:44.800
Where is she?

00:06:46.490 --> 00:06:49.840
Some students saw you and 
the president together.

00:06:50.280 --> 00:06:51.680
Rina-senpai is...

00:06:56.120 --> 00:06:59.850
Rina-senpai can't come here 
because of certain circumstances.

00:06:59.850 --> 00:07:02.260
Circumstances? What circumstances?

00:07:02.610 --> 00:07:04.770
I... can't say...

00:07:05.060 --> 00:07:07.230
You expect us to accept that?

00:07:11.230 --> 00:07:13.740
When is she coming back?

00:07:13.740 --> 00:07:15.420
Without the president...

00:07:15.730 --> 00:07:17.740
...the school festival can't go on.

00:07:18.500 --> 00:07:21.250
I promise I'll bring back Rina-senpai.

00:07:21.620 --> 00:07:24.500
I don't want to disappoint her
 when she returns.

00:07:24.980 --> 00:07:27.630
I want to present her with the 
best school festival possible.

00:07:27.630 --> 00:07:32.380
So please handle the festival 
until I bring her back!

00:07:32.720 --> 00:07:34.600
Lend me your strength!

00:07:36.540 --> 00:07:39.640
It's for the president, right?

00:07:40.300 --> 00:07:41.350
Yes.

00:07:42.320 --> 00:07:45.000
It must be quite a serious matter

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:47.230
if the very responsible president can't come.

00:07:47.230 --> 00:07:50.860
I still can't accept it, 
but until the president returns,

00:07:50.860 --> 00:07:55.840
the student council has to come together 
to make the festival a success, right?

00:07:56.930 --> 00:07:58.370
I'm back.

00:07:58.900 --> 00:08:01.350
Itsuki-kun! Where's the president?

00:08:01.350 --> 00:08:02.360
We already...

00:08:02.360 --> 00:08:03.740
...discussed that.

00:08:03.740 --> 00:08:05.020
I'm counting on you.

00:08:05.020 --> 00:08:05.880
What?

00:08:14.040 --> 00:08:14.980
Kota.

00:08:15.870 --> 00:08:17.640
You got a minute?

00:08:21.380 --> 00:08:25.380
So you're fighting 
the Darkers in real life?

00:08:22.140 --> 00:08:26.140
<b>Kendo is Life</b>

00:08:25.380 --> 00:08:27.780
Yeah, though I doubt you believe me.

00:08:28.780 --> 00:08:32.700
Normally I wouldn't, but I did see them.

00:08:32.700 --> 00:08:35.280
So, what happened to Izumi-senpai?

00:08:35.650 --> 00:08:36.760
Well...

00:08:37.680 --> 00:08:39.660
She was kidnapped, huh?

00:08:40.030 --> 00:08:41.790
Isn't that bad?

00:08:41.790 --> 00:08:44.720
Don't worry. I'll save her.

00:08:44.720 --> 00:08:47.170
But if you're actually fighting them,

00:08:47.740 --> 00:08:49.670
couldn't you die?

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:51.230
It's not that big a deal.

00:08:51.520 --> 00:08:53.680
It's not that different from the game.

00:08:53.680 --> 00:08:54.640
Are you...

00:08:55.720 --> 00:08:58.110
Are you trying to handle 
everything on your own?

00:08:58.110 --> 00:09:00.810
No, I'm not. Aika's with me.

00:09:00.810 --> 00:09:02.930
Then I'll help, too.

00:09:02.930 --> 00:09:03.680
You can't!

00:09:09.380 --> 00:09:11.870
Why not? It is bad, isn't it?

00:09:11.870 --> 00:09:13.370
No.

00:09:14.060 --> 00:09:15.780
You're just...

00:09:16.320 --> 00:09:17.700
Take care of the café, okay?

00:09:17.700 --> 00:09:18.920
The café?

00:09:18.920 --> 00:09:22.950
Y-You know, because Aika 
will be gone, too. So...

00:09:24.050 --> 00:09:25.460
I'm going now.

00:09:27.100 --> 00:09:28.070
Itsuki.

00:09:29.320 --> 00:09:31.090
It's not that bad, right?

00:09:32.780 --> 00:09:34.280
You'll come back, right?

00:09:35.210 --> 00:09:36.560
Of course.

00:09:50.770 --> 00:09:52.080
Enemy attack!

00:09:52.080 --> 00:09:53.610
They went that way!

00:09:58.820 --> 00:10:03.450
<b>[The Dark Falz]</b> The greatest threat to the universe that commands all Darkers. It becomes physically substantial by acquiring a vessel to serve as its core and, even if it is destroyed, it can be resurrected countless times by acquiring new vessels. Because of this, completely destroying it is very difficult, and it is primarily dealt with by sealing it away. It takes on multiple forms including a humanoid form resembling its vessel or a massive final form tens of meters tall.

00:10:03.450 --> 00:10:08.750
<b>[Mining Base]</b> A base established on Planet Lillipa by the ARKS. Outwardly it is a metal ore mining facility, but underneath is the Dark Falz Apprentice. Though it has attempted to revive itself several times in the past, it has always been stopped and sealed away once again by the ARKS.

00:10:09.170 --> 00:10:12.500
<i>Students, let's do everything we can</i>

00:10:12.500 --> 00:10:14.210
<i>to make this a memorable</i>

00:10:14.210 --> 00:10:15.960
school festival.

00:10:16.400 --> 00:10:21.470
<i>There is an after party planned for 
after the school festival ends today.</i>

00:10:21.970 --> 00:10:23.600
What does this mean?

00:10:23.600 --> 00:10:25.640
Is she not coming back?

00:10:25.640 --> 00:10:26.730
No way.

00:10:27.060 --> 00:10:28.230
Is something wrong?

00:10:28.660 --> 00:10:30.730
We found this in the classroom this morning.

00:10:31.270 --> 00:10:32.480
It's Ai-Ai's.

00:10:33.460 --> 00:10:35.510
She hasn't been to the dorm or school.

00:10:35.510 --> 00:10:37.150
We can't get in touch with her, either.

00:10:37.770 --> 00:10:39.100
I see.

00:10:39.100 --> 00:10:41.530
Well, in any case, let's start 
getting the café ready.

00:10:41.900 --> 00:10:44.390
Hey, Ai-Ai's missing!

00:10:44.390 --> 00:10:45.910
Now, hold on.

00:10:47.150 --> 00:10:49.780
I'm sure Suzuki-san has her reasons.

00:10:50.340 --> 00:10:52.420
You guys are always with her.

00:10:54.200 --> 00:10:56.340
She was working really hard...

00:10:56.640 --> 00:11:00.130
There could be some reason she's missing.

00:11:00.590 --> 00:11:04.640
So let's make this fun for Ai-Ai, too.

00:11:04.960 --> 00:11:08.240
Kayano, don't casually call her Ai-Ai, too.

00:11:08.240 --> 00:11:10.040
What? I can't?

00:11:10.040 --> 00:11:12.250
But let's do our best for Ai-Ai.

00:11:12.250 --> 00:11:13.020
Yeah.

00:11:21.780 --> 00:11:23.660
<i>This is an emergency announcement.</i>

00:11:23.660 --> 00:11:27.340
<i>The Dark Falz Apprentice has 
been detected on Planet Lillipa.</i>

00:11:27.340 --> 00:11:28.300
Let's go.

00:11:27.810 --> 00:11:30.300
<i>All ARKS, please prepare to depart.</i>

00:11:37.930 --> 00:11:39.300
Rina-senpai.

00:11:40.150 --> 00:11:42.060
This video was from several hours ago.

00:11:42.340 --> 00:11:47.180
The body of the Dark Falz is 
sealed away underneath this base.

00:11:47.180 --> 00:11:48.210
What?

00:11:48.210 --> 00:11:51.690
This is the worst case scenario 
we could have predicted.

00:11:51.690 --> 00:11:55.300
The Dark Falz will become one
 with Izumi Rina shortly

00:11:55.300 --> 00:11:56.440
and be resurrected.

00:11:56.440 --> 00:11:57.590
No...

00:11:58.060 --> 00:12:00.140
Once we're ready to depart,

00:12:00.140 --> 00:12:03.840
the ARKS will strike together 
to stop the Dark Falz.

00:12:03.840 --> 00:12:06.450
Wait! What will happen to Rina-senpai?

00:12:06.940 --> 00:12:08.360
Unfortunately...

00:12:08.360 --> 00:12:10.140
You're going to let her die?

00:12:10.140 --> 00:12:11.460
Calm down, Itsuki.

00:12:12.210 --> 00:12:15.040
The situation is beyond your control.

00:12:15.040 --> 00:12:18.580
If we do nothing,
the Dark Falz will invade Earth

00:12:19.040 --> 00:12:21.470
and inflict catastrophic damage.

00:12:23.260 --> 00:12:27.870
Are you willing to sacrifice all 
of humankind for Izumi Rina?

00:12:30.050 --> 00:12:31.980
We'll handle the rest.

00:12:34.500 --> 00:12:35.440
Itsuki!

00:12:35.440 --> 00:12:36.440
Wait.

00:12:39.060 --> 00:12:39.950
Take this.

00:12:42.040 --> 00:12:43.520
Florenberg?

00:12:47.890 --> 00:12:49.040
Hey, Musashi.

00:12:49.040 --> 00:12:49.790
What?

00:12:50.120 --> 00:12:50.720
Hey.

00:12:50.720 --> 00:12:52.410
D-Don't call me that!

00:12:53.660 --> 00:12:55.420
You got a second?

00:12:55.740 --> 00:12:56.510
What?

00:12:58.640 --> 00:13:00.000
What happened to Sasaki-kun?

00:13:00.460 --> 00:13:02.010
He's getting pamphlets.

00:13:02.560 --> 00:13:04.010
He's taking too long.

00:13:04.430 --> 00:13:08.160
What? That's why the president is missing?

00:13:08.600 --> 00:13:11.260
And Itsuki-kun is no slouch.

00:13:11.560 --> 00:13:13.540
Anyway, that's that. I'm counting on you.

00:13:13.540 --> 00:13:15.450
He doesn't have to be so secretive.

00:13:15.450 --> 00:13:17.770
Itsuki-kun could've told me.

00:13:17.770 --> 00:13:19.540
Don't be like that.

00:13:19.540 --> 00:13:21.270
It must've been hard for him to say anything.

00:13:21.690 --> 00:13:24.180
Got it. I'll see you later.

00:13:30.110 --> 00:13:31.280
Huh?!

00:13:31.860 --> 00:13:33.810
I overheard your conversation.

00:13:34.100 --> 00:13:34.790
What?

00:13:34.790 --> 00:13:37.670
But I don't think it's true.

00:13:37.670 --> 00:13:39.920
But...

00:13:43.240 --> 00:13:44.800
Tell me the truth!

00:13:48.800 --> 00:13:50.430
Aika-chan, wait.

00:13:53.320 --> 00:13:54.500
Matoi-sama.

00:13:54.500 --> 00:13:56.860
You mean to go with him, don't you?

00:13:57.220 --> 00:13:59.440
But what do you plan to do?

00:14:00.290 --> 00:14:03.300
Rina hasn't been absorbed completely yet.

00:14:03.960 --> 00:14:05.940
It's possible she can be saved.

00:14:06.600 --> 00:14:08.700
Even if she can be saved...

00:14:09.250 --> 00:14:11.460
I know how you were saved

00:14:11.460 --> 00:14:14.700
when you were once absorbed by the darkness.

00:14:15.960 --> 00:14:17.050
Excuse me.

00:14:23.830 --> 00:14:25.210
What do you want?

00:14:25.950 --> 00:14:27.590
I have a request.

00:14:28.470 --> 00:14:30.220
It's something only you can do...

00:14:31.040 --> 00:14:32.090
Kuna-san.

00:14:36.070 --> 00:14:38.850
Fine, you insidious four-eyes.

00:14:39.430 --> 00:14:41.230
Something only I can do, right?

00:14:41.540 --> 00:14:45.170
That must be emboldening those 
who are headed to the fight.

00:14:45.460 --> 00:14:46.860
So...

00:14:51.440 --> 00:14:52.750
Don't try to stop me!

00:14:53.620 --> 00:14:54.790
I won't.

00:14:57.700 --> 00:15:02.030
I told you that protecting you is my duty.

00:15:02.030 --> 00:15:04.410
Is there a way to save Rina-senpai?

00:15:04.410 --> 00:15:06.220
Let me handle that.

00:15:06.630 --> 00:15:10.580
Your only job is surviving and 
bringing Rina home safely.

00:15:10.580 --> 00:15:11.380
Got it?

00:15:12.520 --> 00:15:13.510
Got it.

00:15:13.510 --> 00:15:16.180
I've been waiting for you, friends!

00:15:18.750 --> 00:15:23.780
The end to a profound drama 
deserves an appropriate stage.

00:15:25.770 --> 00:15:26.820
Kota...

00:15:26.820 --> 00:15:29.280
Don't call me by my real name!

00:15:30.720 --> 00:15:31.920
I'm going with you!

00:15:31.920 --> 00:15:34.200
I told you to handle the café.

00:15:34.620 --> 00:15:37.070
I shall defend the café and my friends.

00:15:37.070 --> 00:15:39.390
That's me, Koa, and that's how I roll!

00:15:41.710 --> 00:15:42.880
You...

00:15:44.380 --> 00:15:46.210
You can lean on your friends.

00:15:47.580 --> 00:15:48.340
Yeah.

00:15:48.830 --> 00:15:51.400
Itsuki didn't want to get you involved.

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:54.970
The Darkers could attack you in real life.

00:15:54.970 --> 00:15:56.800
I know that.

00:15:56.800 --> 00:16:01.310
But nothing's more exciting 
than when your friends

00:16:01.600 --> 00:16:04.350
come to save the day at the final battle!

00:16:05.080 --> 00:16:06.390
Don't worry.

00:16:06.390 --> 00:16:09.700
I'm not your only friend 
who has come to help you!

00:16:09.700 --> 00:16:10.440
What?

00:16:12.610 --> 00:16:14.160
Let us handle this.

00:16:14.160 --> 00:16:16.960
We'll make your love come true.

00:16:16.960 --> 00:16:18.070
We support you.

00:16:16.960 --> 00:16:18.460
What? Love?

00:16:18.070 --> 00:16:19.900
It's great to be young.

00:16:19.900 --> 00:16:21.370
That's youth.

00:16:20.160 --> 00:16:21.370
Uh, what are you talking about?

00:16:21.860 --> 00:16:24.320
Once we finish this quest,

00:16:24.320 --> 00:16:27.200
will Itsuki-dono be confessing 
his feelings to Rina-dono?

00:16:27.200 --> 00:16:29.870
This reminds me of when I was 17.

00:16:27.990 --> 00:16:29.870
Uh, confessing what?

00:16:29.870 --> 00:16:31.380
Don't be so secretive.

00:16:31.380 --> 00:16:34.510
If it's so important, let me handle it.

00:16:34.940 --> 00:16:38.940
When it comes to loving someone, 
there are no lies or truth.

00:16:38.940 --> 00:16:39.940
Hey!

00:16:42.320 --> 00:16:44.770
I'm going to hit you when we get home.

00:16:45.180 --> 00:16:45.950
Sure.

00:16:47.280 --> 00:16:50.120
Let's go! We'll break through enemy lines!

00:16:50.120 --> 00:16:51.780
Yeah!

00:16:53.530 --> 00:16:57.780
Thanks for coming, everyone!

00:16:58.190 --> 00:17:02.040
For all of you heading off to battle,

00:17:02.390 --> 00:17:04.890
I'll sing my heart out!

00:17:06.460 --> 00:17:08.920
Brilliantly, intensely, and vividly!

00:17:09.890 --> 00:17:12.420
Get amped with me now!

00:17:13.320 --> 00:17:15.040
"OUR Fighting!"

00:17:20.470 --> 00:17:21.470
They're coming.

00:17:24.100 --> 00:17:24.980
Watch out!

00:17:27.450 --> 00:17:28.770
Let me handle this!

00:17:31.980 --> 00:17:33.650
We'll create an opening.

00:17:40.070 --> 00:17:41.650
They're worthy opponents.

00:17:42.230 --> 00:17:44.580
There's nothing my blade can't cut.

00:17:53.200 --> 00:17:54.090
Take this.

00:17:54.930 --> 00:17:55.840
Fire.

00:18:49.320 --> 00:18:52.190
Stay out of my way!

00:18:54.320 --> 00:18:55.570
All right!

00:19:06.330 --> 00:19:07.440
No, you don't!

00:19:15.020 --> 00:19:16.800
I still can't believe it,

00:19:17.120 --> 00:19:21.320
but we need to beat this quest to 
bring the president back, right?

00:19:21.320 --> 00:19:22.340
Konoe-san?

00:19:23.300 --> 00:19:24.990
Are you okay, Itsuki?

00:19:25.940 --> 00:19:28.220
Who's the ARKS in the Lillipa suit?

00:19:28.650 --> 00:19:29.940
It's Konoe-san.

00:19:29.940 --> 00:19:30.980
Konoe?

00:19:34.160 --> 00:19:35.210
Konoe Mika!

00:19:35.730 --> 00:19:36.910
Match my attack.

00:19:47.740 --> 00:19:48.750
We did it!

00:19:54.250 --> 00:19:55.580
Konoe-san!

00:20:05.760 --> 00:20:07.740
Damn it. What should we do?

00:20:09.060 --> 00:20:11.520
Let us handle this.

00:20:11.920 --> 00:20:12.770
Don't forget.

00:20:13.130 --> 00:20:16.080
Itsuki! We'll create an opening,

00:20:16.080 --> 00:20:17.770
so you finish it off!

00:20:18.180 --> 00:20:20.900
Got it. I'm counting on you guys.

00:20:26.070 --> 00:20:27.580
Spinning Attack!

00:20:28.140 --> 00:20:30.830
My blade of justice will pierce your body!

00:20:32.370 --> 00:20:34.580
I'll cut you down!

00:20:34.580 --> 00:20:36.160
Impudent!

00:20:42.550 --> 00:20:43.550
Once more!

00:20:43.550 --> 00:20:44.800
Crush him!

00:20:47.130 --> 00:20:48.750
Now, Itsuki!

00:20:54.560 --> 00:20:57.560
Move!

00:21:10.580 --> 00:21:11.480
Itsuki!

00:21:11.480 --> 00:21:12.700
What is this?

00:21:23.520 --> 00:21:24.590
It stopped?

00:21:24.960 --> 00:21:26.810
Guys, are you okay?

00:21:26.810 --> 00:21:30.130
We're fine, but we can't get to you.

00:21:30.130 --> 00:21:32.100
We can't climb this.

00:21:32.600 --> 00:21:33.460
Then...

00:21:33.460 --> 00:21:34.850
Itsuki!

00:21:35.860 --> 00:21:37.100
Go get her!

00:21:38.510 --> 00:21:42.000
Tachibana Itsuki! I'm counting on you!

00:21:42.330 --> 00:21:44.240
You have to save her!

00:21:44.580 --> 00:21:45.640
Guys...

00:22:00.430 --> 00:22:02.060
What is that?

00:22:04.150 --> 00:22:08.450
That's the final form of the Dark Falz.

00:23:40.730 --> 00:23:42.270
<b>Next Episode</b>

00:23:42.270 --> 00:24:10.140
<b>Next Episode</b>

00:23:43.890 --> 00:23:47.440
The final battle is approaching. 
Pull yourself together, Itsuki.

00:23:47.440 --> 00:23:48.440
I know.

00:23:48.440 --> 00:23:49.570
Are your weapons all right?

00:23:49.570 --> 00:23:50.170
Yeah.

00:23:50.170 --> 00:23:51.680
You have Trimates, as well?

00:23:51.680 --> 00:23:52.730
Of course.

00:23:52.730 --> 00:23:54.180
And Star Atomizers?

00:23:54.180 --> 00:23:55.940
I'll be fine.

00:23:55.940 --> 00:23:57.840
I see you've got Moon Atomizers, as well.

00:23:57.840 --> 00:24:01.120
Check to see if you have all 
your units equipped, too.

00:24:01.120 --> 00:24:03.610
You should check your 
entire item pack, as well.

00:24:03.610 --> 00:24:06.980
Let's go, Aika! Let's go save Rina-senpai!

00:24:06.980 --> 00:24:09.040
Wait, Itsuki!
